            "title": "New law bans blindfolds, restraints in transporting kids to residential treatment centers",
            "outlet": "UpNorthLive",
            "date": "2026-10-05",
            "date_label": "Oct 5, 2026",
            "url": "https://upnorthlive.com/news/local/new-law-bans-blindfolds-restraints-in-transporting-kids-to-residential-treatment-centers",
            "type": "event",
            "summary": "Michigan Governor Gretchen Whitmer signed House Bill 5514, which prohibits the use of blindfolds and restraints by private transportation companies when moving children to residential treatment centers and restricts transport between 9 p.m. and 6 a.m. The legislation was introduced after parental complaints about transport practices.",
