            "url": "https://hoodline.com/2026/10/michigan-bill-banning-teen-transport-shackles-heads-to-whitmer-after-paris-hilton-testimony/",
            "type": "event",
            "summary": "A Michigan bill that would prohibit the use of handcuffs, blindfolds, hoods, chains, and straitjackets on children during transport to residential treatment programs has been sent to Governor Whitmer for signature. The legislation follows testimony from survivors, including Paris Hilton and Kyra Frankowski, who described being restrained during transport. The bill also limits nighttime pickups and restricts certain physical restraints to situations where no other means can prevent imminent serious harm.",
